+	 * Anywhere in the value, ignoring ASCII case as before (VitaSurf).
+	 *
+	 * This called strncasecmp at every position of the attribute, and
+	 * a GitHub page asks it 21,544 times, mostly of long class lists:
+	 * at some 7500 instructions a question it was a fifth of all the
+	 * time selection took. Only a position whose first character
